# Quest for Ancient Secrets: with five counters (three from a Thought Scour on Bot1, one from each of two on Bot2),
# Bot1 casts a fourth Thought Scour on Bot2. The spell, put into Bot1's graveyard, triggers Quest, and with that trigger
# on the stack Bot1 activates Quest: five counters off and the sacrifice, targeting Bot1. The ability resolves first
# and shuffles Bot1's graveyard, the Scour included, into its library. The trigger then resolves for an enchantment that is
# gone, a new object in a library if anything (CR 400.7): Bot1 may accept, and no counter goes on anything.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Mox Sapphire
Mox Sapphire
Mox Sapphire
Mox Sapphire
Quest for Ancient Secrets
Thought Scour
Island
Island
Thought Scour
Thought Scour
Thought Scour
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain x27

